        {
          "text": "ndipo hao wazee ishirini na wanne huanguka mbele zake yeye aketiye juu ya kile kiti cha enzi, nao humsujudia yeye aliye hai hata milele na milele, nao huzitupa taji zao mbele ya kile kiti cha enzi, wakisema, ",
